Next actions:
1) Add and migrate user entitlement columns (`websiteAddonActive`, `websiteAddonSubscriptionId`), wire webhook lifecycle updates for add-on variant, and expose these in subscription status APIs.
2) Enforce add-on entitlement checks on all protected website-builder/booking endpoints and on public site serving (`/api/site/:slug`) so cancellation disables the public site.
3) Add migration files for `restaurant_websites` and `table_bookings`, then align implemented payload/schema/UX with required fields and status model (including optional menu-link behavior).